Package: jarvis-fonts
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Muhammad AbdElHay <mmAbdelhay@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: fontconfig, fonts-inter, fonts-ibm-plex, fonts-noto-core
Section: fonts
Priority: optional
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: Arabic and Latin fonts for @DISTRO_NAME@
 IBM Plex and Noto Arabic faces (Sans, Naskh, Kufi) with fontconfig rules
 so Arabic text in the @DISTRO_NAME@ interface never shows empty boxes.
